            "review_title": "Review at Mr. Bistek",
            "review_text": "Neuhauswelt\nIpoh, Malaysia356 contributions\n0\nThe meat is reasonably priced and quite satisfying.\nApr 2024 • Couples\nThe meat was cooked just right. I ordered it medium rare, and it came out exactly that way. It's actually quite difficult to cook it this well. I wish it was cut a little thicker.\n\nThe meat was quite good, and worth the price. The sauce has a bit of a strong flavor, probably Vietnamese, but it's not bad. If it doesn't suit your taste, you don't need to add it.\n\nMy wife and I live in Malaysia, and the beef there is not very tasty, so we're having trouble. Maybe we should come to Vietnam to eat steak or yakiniku?\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten April 16, 2024",
